  - LineID: Middle
    Speaker: Chime
    text: 'What is that? Quick, that thing is going to break down the window. The
      front door is stuck, so we''ll have to go down the chimney if we want to get
      to Darry before it does. '
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: female
